##  Current status of created products 

This folder contains outputs generated using the BiodivMapR workflow, including spatial products for biodiversity analysis.

## The current set of products includes:

Alpha diversity maps (e.g., species richness or functional diversity depending on configuration)
Beta diversity maps (turnover and/or compositional dissimilarity metrics)
Raster outputs in standard geospatial formats (e.g., GeoTIFF)
